            "description": {
              "content": "Sends an HTTP request through the proxy and streams back the response as newline-delimited JSON (NDJSON). The response stream emits typed events including response-start, response-body-part, and response-end. Request and response body data is base64-encoded.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
